WEBVTT

00:28:26.605 --> 00:28:30.423
And I thought, "Why does this surprise me,
when I'm constantly preaching this?"

00:28:30.447 --> 00:28:33.502
But my partner, Rayya, died in January.

00:28:33.526 --> 00:28:36.952
I had a novel due in August.

00:28:36.976 --> 00:28:41.931
And I had to start from the place
of my deepest grief

00:28:41.955 --> 00:28:43.948
to write a novel that was due.

00:28:43.972 --> 00:28:46.618
I started writing it
in the middle of the spring

00:28:46.642 --> 00:28:48.699
once I had sort of pulled myself together,

00:28:48.723 --> 00:28:52.665
and I had started this novel before Rayya
got sick and before we were together.

00:28:52.689 --> 00:28:54.880
It was pitched and promised
to my publisher

00:28:54.904 --> 00:29:00.043
as a lighthearted, happy,
sexy, fun romp of a book,